   "kind": "lpStory",
   "heading": "About the Department",
   "headingMods": [
    "mrg32"
   ],
   "text": [
    "The Department of Finance, Accounting & Economics forms the analytical backbone of ",
    {
     "strong": "ATLAS ISME,"
    },
    " blending financial expertise, accounting discipline, and economic intelligence to drive informed, strategic decision-making. Students go beyond understanding systems; they learn to question, optimise, and reimagine them.\n\nWith a curriculum that balances academic rigour and real-world application, the department builds critical thinking, ethical judgment, and data-driven problem-solving skills. Industry-recognised certification pathways with ",
    {
     "strong": "National Stock Exchange (NSE), CFA Institute, National Institute of Securities Markets (NISM), The London Institute of Banking & Finance (LIBF), Financial Planning Standards Board (FPSB), Association of Investment Bankers of India (AiBi),"
    },
    " combined with global exposure, live projects, and industry mentorship, ensure graduates emerge ",
    {
     "strong": "career-ready, globally relevant, and equipped for leadership across finance, policy, and entrepreneurial roles."
    }
   ],
