       "title": "Global & Future‑Facing Perspective",
       "text": "Students explore global markets, fintech innovations, behavioural economics, ESG finance, and data-led decision-making, preparing them for a rapidly transforming financial ecosystem.",
       "backgroundImage": "/assets/images/advantages/partnership/cdn/vector-paren-2.png",
       "backgroundRepeat": "no-repeat"
      },
